---
title: "pipecat init"
sidebarTitle: "init"
description: "pipecat init writes the coding-agent guide and can scaffold a bot."
---

No heading on this page names a command, so its options are `pipecat init`'s.

## Options

<ParamField path="TARGET" type="string">
  Project directory.
</ParamField>

<ParamField path="--name / -n" type="string">
  Project name.
</ParamField>

<ParamField path="--context-hub / --no-context-hub" type="boolean" default="true">
  Register the Context Hub MCP server. "true" and `True` are the same default.
</ParamField>

<ParamField path="--dry-run" type="flag" default="false">
  Print what would be written.
</ParamField>
